  {
    "episode_id": 48662,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/8/48662.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Let's talk about a couple of things that have raised some concerns in Arkansas. Let's start first with possible cuts to some federal parks. This would be something that would be under your jurisdiction in your chairmanship capacity here. Have you had any conversation or gotten any additional clarity on how deep those cuts may be and is Arkansas protected from those cuts?",
