        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The chairperson holds decision-making power or influence over federal funding allocations affecting Arkansas.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Arkansas could be disproportionately affected by federal park budget reductions if not protected.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Clarity on the scope of cuts is currently lacking but expected to become available through official channels.",
        "confidence": 0.89
